    count: 1,
    reason:
      "findSessionProject readdir loop — name is a readdirSync(projectsDir)-enumerated real in-tree directory name, not caller-supplied; join builds a candidate to probe. Measured: exactly one occurrence in the real tree, packages/agents/agent-run.ts:708 (`const candidate = join(projectsDir, name);`), inside findSessionProject's readdir loop.",
